äLaurel was mesmerized, staring at the pale things with wide eyes. They were terrifyingly beautiful - too beautiful for words.
Laurel turned to the mirror again, her eyes on the hovering petals that floated beside her head. They looked almost like wings.
In this extraordinary tale of magic and intrigue, romance and danger, everything you thought you knew about faeries will be changed forever."ë
é"Cho bi mat cua phong 406": cau de tu cua Vu khong dua chung ta thang vao bau khong khi ke can, tham chi la o ben trong, cua su dien. Nhan vat nguoi dien la mot ke da vang, mot ten Cha Chet lan luot mang biet danh "Mat-Khi", roi "Chet-Khung", han lan quat trong cac thu vien voi mot tham vong dien khung: tro thanh "ga Cha Chet viet van bang tieng Phap". Nhung qua khu da duoi kip han duoi hinh thuc mot buc thu, va can phong bi mat cua han bi xam nhap, bi thu hep dien tich boi mot thu khien han co cam giac kinh tom xen lan trong cho tham kin: su quan tam. Dua chau gai cua han (cung viet van bang tieng Phap) lam the gioi tuong chung da hoan toan dong kin cua han bong co nhung con chao dao khong ngo, du mong muon duy nhat cua han chi gian don: "toi voi dong sach se la mot".
Them lan nua mot nha van, tiep sau Anton Tchekhov cua Phong so 6 va Jean-Paul Sartre cua Buon non, dung van chuong de di vao cai the gioi dac biet ay. Va them lan nua the gioi nguoi dien lai co them cho minh mot tac pham van chuong bac thay, ky ten Linda Le."¥

±
Cai chet den tu mot cuon bang. Hai doi nam nu vi thanh nien lan luot chet boi con dau bot nghet tim mot tuan sau khi xem phai mot cuon bang la trong mot nha nghi ngoai o Tokyo, ben tren mot cai gieng cu...
Me man kham pha ra bi an dang sau nhung cai chet kinh hoang do, Asakawa, mot phong vien dang hao huc vi danh vong lao vao cuoc truy tim dau vet. Den muc ga tu minh xem cuon bang, va doi mat voi loi de doa hai hung ke nao do da dat trong nhung hinh anh cuon bang ghi lai. Bay ngay con lai, vong quay cua Ring bat dau, su khiep hai cua ke da thay ngon nui lua phun trao, nhung cai mat ma quai, va cuoi cung, cai gieng cu tieu dieu giua khu rung vang... bat dau ngam vao trong tim. Su that la dau? Dau la loi nguyen, dau la loi giai?
Hay thuong thuc tac pham cua Suzuki Koji, tac pham kinh di kinh dien da lam mua lam gio bang nhung thanh cong khong lo o dat nuoc Phu Tang trong hang thap ky, truoc khi buoc len man anh voi hai bo phim noi tieng "Ringu" cua Nhat Ban va "The Ring" cua Hollywood. Xuat khau noi so dac trung Nhat Ban ra toan the gioi, Ring thoa man nhung ai dang tim kiem khoai cam trong noi rung minh, cung nhung triet ly cao sang va sau sac cua mot trong nhung kiet tac cua the loai.
Hon ma, quy du - dai dien cua cai ac - chinh la mot phan cua the gioi con nguoi. Do lai la mot thong diep nua trong tac pham."¬
ø"Thoi nien thieu cua Sherlock Holmes" la bo tieu thuyet dau tien ve quang doi tre con cua tham tu huyen thoai Sherlock Holmes.
Ra mat lan dau nam 2007, bo sach cua Shane Peacock ngay lap tuc thu hut su chu y cua doc gia tai nhieu quoc gia tren the gioi va gianh duoc hon 40 giai thuong danh gia: Giai thuong Sach cua nam cua Hiep hoi Thu vien Canada, Top 10 truyen bi an cho thieu nhi, Giai thuong Arthur Ellis cho the loai truyen hinh su thanh thieu nien, Huy chuong vang cho sach cua nam cua Tap chi Foreward...
Hinh anh mot Sherlock Holmes tai ba voi tri thong minh nhanh nhay, su quan sat tinh te, nhung phan doan logic trong tac pham cua Arthur Conan Doyle da lam say me biet bao the he doc gia. Tuy nhien, chua co tac pham nao cho thay, tai nang cua Sherlock Holmes bat dau boc lo tu khi nao? Hoan canh gia dinh, moi truong song tu thoi tho be co tac dong toi Sherlock Holmes ra sao? Ngay ca bac si Watson - nguoi ban than thiet cua Sherlock Holmes cung "chua bao gio nghe anh ke ve gia dinh va quang doi tho au cua anh... Toi da tuong anh mo coi va khong con ai than thich...". Qua Thoi nien thieu cua Sherlock Holmes, Shane Peacock ly giai nhung cau hoi do va giup doc gia tiep tuc duoc dam minh trong cam giac hoi hop gay can qua tung vu an day kich tinh.
Nhan xet ve tieu thuyet cua Shane Peacock, to The Global and Mail cho rang, tieu thuyet cua Shane Peacook danh cho doc gia tre, nhung nguoi lon cung cam thay thich thu voi nhung cuoc phieu luu co tiet tau nhanh, day kich tinh...
Ba tap dau tien cua bo truyen gom Mat qua tinh tuong, Cu nga tu than, Co gai bi an...
Trong "Mat qua tinh tuong", Shane Peacock da kheo leo tao ra nhung tinh tiet li giai su kin tieng cua ngai tham tu Sherlock Holmes khi nhac den gia dinh minh. Ong da thanh cong trong viec tao ra mot vu an mang gay can voi tiet tau hoan hao... cung nhu gay an tuong voi hinh anh nao nhiet cua thanh Luan Don thoi nu hoang Victoria, khien cho su tan bao man ro cua khu East End hien len song dong qua tung trang sach... (Quili & Quire)
***
Shane Peacock la mot nha van nha bao da tai, ong viet nhieu the loai nhu tieu thuyet, kich, kich ban phim, tieu su. Nhan vat trong cac tac pham cua Shane Peacock deu la nhung nguoi loi lac, lam duoc nhung viec phi thuong." 
«Four mysterious letters change Miranda's world forever.
By sixth grade, Miranda and her best friend, Sal, know how to navigate their New York City neighborhood. They know where it's safe to go, like the local grocery store, and they know whom to avoid, like the crazy guy on the corner.
But things start to unravel. Sal gets punched by a new kid for what seems like no reason, and he shuts Miranda out of his life. The apartment key that Miranda's mom keeps hidden for emergencies is stolen. And then Miranda finds a mysterious note scrawled on a tiny slip of paper: 
I am coming to save your friend's life, and my own.
I must ask two favors. First, you must write me a letter.
The notes keep coming, and Miranda slowly realizes that whoever is leaving them knows all about her, including things that have not even happened yet. Each message brings her closer to believing that only she can prevent a tragic death. Until the final note makes her think she's too late."–
ÕLa mo uoc ve mot the gioi day ap yeu thuong, the gioi cua nhung trai tim nhan ai, cua nhung tam long biet chia se, cam thong. Ngoan muc va gay can nhu mot vu dieu thang bang tren day. Mot ben la sex dong tinh, mot ben la bao luc, toi ac. Chi can nga ve ben nay hay nghieng ve ben kia mot chut la mat thang bang va ...roi. Nhung Vu Dinh Giang da chon mot cai dich o phia truoc, va anh chi nham vao diem sang ay de luot sang dau day ben kia ma khong bi ... lo da."„

‡
Vuon nha minh da duoc don sach vao cuoi tuan, cu hoa da duoc dua tro ve dat tu cach day ca thang, bat dau qua trinh "ngu dong". Sang mua dong, me tre nai hon. Thuc day som roi ma chi muon nam them trong chan am khi thay ben ngoai chua sang han. Lay het dung khi ra bep van lo nuong lam nong lai thuc an sang, roi lai tro ve trum chan. Cho den khi chiec lo keu tittttttttttttttttttttt thi cung la luc con gai lon den gio day sua soan di hoc. Chan tran giam len san go, nhung ngon chan be ti nhon nhon, vua di vua cup lai the ma bao di tat vao ngay thi cai "Nhung con khong lanh!".
Mua dong, tat ca bien thanh ba gia voi mo bay mo ba. Troi ret, ao trong ao ngoai tuong nhu neu nga mot cai la kho dung day duoc, lan tron nhu bi.
Bua com mua dong co the thieu nguoi neu nhu lich cua bo qua ban ron. Nhung bua trang mieng buoi toi thuong cung nhau. Toi nay bo bao "Them an cai gi do nong ma co nuoc". Me goi y "Banh troi nuoc duong gung", bo bao "The thi lai phai nhai". Me phi cuoi, "Bo da qua tuoi can duoc an com bung roi day a!". Mot tin hieu cho thay ai do duoc chieu qua da.
Muoi phut sau, ca nha chung nhau bat che troi nuoc. Nuoc duong gung nong thom quen voi tung bien banh bot nep deo min, trang nuot.
Ngoai troi lanh leo la the, nhung trong nha khong khi luon am. Nhung ngay mua dong lanh, tinh cam them gan bo. Day cung la ly do vi sao mua dong duoc mong cho den vay..."␀␀p@"	ÖÎQ∏@"	R∏ÖÎQ
